E
order pole~
ATTENTION: All soldiers must report here before being sent into the
battlefield. Most  of the city is in ruins but the rebels have managed to
secure a small portion. They are allowing the people of this rebellious city
to escape, along with vital information.  Finding your way through the burning
wreckage and smoke will be hard.  It will also be hard to distinguish between
friend and foe. Go forth, and kill everything you see.



Please be advised,
the mobs are aggro. This is good for group exp.
-Nameless
~
